//CFpy Specification (prompts):

---
v1a (o3 prompt);

Hi I need to ask a LLM a question about my code base, however in order to simplify my codebase to make it easier to interpret I would like to remove all the code that is currently disabled according to the truth value of the boolean global vars in the globalDefs.py file (note that their truth value may be dynamically defined in globalDefs.py within if statements). Please provide me a tool to first filter my codebase.

